<title>LATVIA: All Latvian T-bill rates fall at auction.</title>
<headline>All Latvian T-bill rates fall at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields on all maturities fell at an auction of Latvian Treasury bills on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD   (LAST WEEK)   ISSUE   BID    SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day	9.73	  9.95	   0.75   2.22   0.75</p>
<p> 91-day	10.29	 10.34	  0.75   1.78   0.75</p>
<p> 182-day     11.51	 11.75	  1.0    3.58   1.0</p>
<p> 364-day     12.37	 12.52	  10.0   21.63  10.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
